@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Student
participant Browser
participant Flask

Student -> Browser : open /exam
Browser -> Flask : GET questions
Flask --> Browser : show form
Student -> Browser : submit answers
Browser -> Flask : POST answers
Flask -> Flask : score percent
Flask --> Student : category page
@enduml
